{coachFirst},

Thank you for requesting an evaluation for {levelName}. I will be your evaluator.

I’ve checked your NCCP record in The Locker and your membership. Before we can start the evaluation tasks, these items need to be completed:

{outstanding}

Below is the chart of every step to become a Certified {levelName} coach, with your status filled in (✓ done, ✗ needs attention). If you’ve already completed something marked ✗, it may not have reached The Locker yet: let me know and we’ll get it fixed up.

{chart}

When you’ve finished, reply to this email or sign in to the portal ({portalUrl}) and I’ll check again. Based on what I’ve documented, you are well on your way!

The full pathway is at {pathwayUrl}

{evaluatorName}
Boxing Canada Coach Evaluator

